Package: CSUBstats
Title: Statistical Functions and Data for Teaching
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Eduardo", "Montoya", email = "emontoya2@csub.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of statistical functions and datasets designed to support
    teaching and learning in both introductory and advanced statistics courses. Developed for use with 
    "Training modules on selected statistical methods" and future educational resources, the package includes curated 
    datasets, statistical functions, and visualization tools tailored for applied data analysis and instruction.
License: GPL-3
